# sweep: --bare --seed-root apps/tailscale/fixtures/connected
# Connected: the reader's tailnet name and address, to save on the computer.
wait-for Connected
expect kobo-cobalt.example.ts.net
expect 100.64.0.7
expect Runs while Cobalt is open.
expect-missing Approve this reader
expect-missing Try again
clean
shot tailscale-connected
# Signing out switches Tailscale off and takes the address off the screen.
tap About Tailscale
wait-for the private network between your own devices
tap Sign out
wait-for This reader forgets its key
tap-id sign-out-confirmed
wait-for Off. Nothing reaches this reader over a tailnet.
expect-missing 100.64.0.7
